  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delegated PDC applied research projects           Vietnam</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Delegerad PDC till&#xe4;mpade forskningsinsatser,      Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekretariat f&#xf6;r forskningssamarbetet och Akt&#xf6;rssamverkan hade en      &#xf6;ppen utlysning f&#xf6;r ans&#xf6;kningar inom &quot;Tillg&#xe5;ng till och till&#xe4;mpad     f&#xf6;rskning&quot;. Resultat blev 9 beviljad projekt med vietnamesisk         partner. Ytterligare ett projeckt beviljades i efterhand.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Secretariat for Research Cooperation and the Project Driven       Cooperation team had an open call for applications called &quot;Access to  and Use of Research Results&quot;. The result was approval for funding of  9 projects with Vietnamese partners. 1 project was approved later.</narrative>
  </description>
